From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 15:40:56 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] ui-egui: Transliterate menu on Review and in the shape and
 text context menu, with a status line

Menu entries "Transliterate" (Latin to Cyrillic, Cyrillic to Latin, Auto-detect) in the Review tab and in the context menu, calling the three
transliteration commands (tools.translitCyrl, tools.translitLatn, tools.translitAuto). Labels go through the interface-language
lookup; the result is shown as a status line ("{n} ... converted", "Nothing to convert", "{n} items skipped ...").
